{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "Base site map shared by web (web/lib/scene/base-site.json, copied by scripts/sync-base-site.mjs) and native (bundled). Kit units: the base strip is 520 units wide; one unit is `kitScale` pt on screen. Art comes from tools/blender/models/base_v7.py and terrain_v7.py; sprite metrics are the Blender camera frames. The base is a paved launch complex on flat land: no mountains, no forest, no player-owned buildings until the player builds them. A fresh base asks for the launchpad first, on the pad site. After that first build, an agency-operated support apron comes online without changing the player's owned structures.",
